extraction_notes: "WB17 Warlords of Russia printed 107-111 (cache p108-p112, cache page = printed folio + 1), read off the text layer; the body figures were read off renders for the warlord-light-machine-cyborg vessel row and checked by book-reconcile. || HEADING: Light Machine, under Cyborg O.C.C.s; the stat block is headed Light Machine Cyborg Soldier/Warrior/Merc, Class: Full Conversion Light Cyborg (printed 108). Listed under Cyborg O.C.C.s on printed 57. mdc_base is stated, so there is no men_of_arms line. || XP: the ladder headed Light Machine Cyborg on the Experience Tables, printed 6. || BODY: mdc_base 170 is the main body of the typical full conversion Light Machine (printed 110). Bionic P.S. 28-30 and P.P. 20-24 are printed as ranges and are not stored as attribute_dice; they are in the Body ability. || BONUSES: +3 initiative, +1 pull punch, +1 strike and parry (printed 110). The bonus list prints a stray empty bullet after the initiative line; nothing is stored for it. The targeting sight''s +1 to strike is printed in the cybernetic systems list and is kept as prose. || RELATED SKILLS: the book gives three MOS skills at +15% from ANY category (stored as a three-pick group over every category inside occ_skills), then two Military or Piloting skills and three others (stored as count 5 with a floor of two across Military and Pilot), and one more at levels 4, 8 and 12. || SECONDARY: two at levels 2, 4, 8 and 13, none at level one. || MONEY: 6D6x10 credits stored (text layer 6D6xlO); 3D6x10 in tradeable goods and the 900-1300 credit monthly salary are in GM Notes. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: the energy rifle of choice, four grenades of choice, and the long coat, cap or hat, scarf, gloves and boots. Four of the eleven standard cybernetic systems have catalog rows and are stored; the rest are in the Standard Cybernetic Systems ability."
